<StudioLayout title="Norman Ascension \u2014 An online medieval life and dynasty RPG, coming to Steam" description="Norman Ascension is an online multiplayer medieval life and dynasty RPG from Strategic Sloth, set in Normandy in 1066. Live a life, raise an heir and carry your House across generations in a persistent shared world. In development, soon to wishlist on Steam.">
<section class="unrevealed-teaser"><div class="container"><a class="unrevealed-back" href="/games/">← Games &amp; experiments</a><div class="unrevealed-teaser-grid"><div class="unrevealed-teaser-copy"><p class="eyebrow">NORMANDY, 1066 · AN ONLINE MEDIEVAL LIFE &amp; DYNASTY RPG · COMING TO STEAM</p><h1>Norman<br><em>Ascension</em></h1><p class="unrevealed-tagline">Every name begins somewhere.</p><p class="unrevealed-description">You begin as an unknown eighteen-year-old with modest means and a name few remember. What will your descendants inherit?</p><div class="unrevealed-state"><span>In development</span><span>Soon to wishlist on Steam</span></div><a class="text-link unrevealed-watch" href="#world">Watch the world turn <span>↓</span></a> <a class="text-link unrevealed-watch unrevealed-site" href="https://remiclassic.github.io/normanascension/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Visit the official site <span>↗</span></a></div><div class="unrevealed-emblem"><svg class="unrevealed-crest" viewBox="0 0 240 290" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M28 28H212V156C212 202 174 237 120 266C66 237 28 202 28 156Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="M40 40H200V155C200 194 166 226 120 251C74 226 40 194 40 155Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-opacity=".35"/><path d="M76 175H164M85 175V110H101V93H113V110H127V93H139V110H155V175M104 174V151A16 16 0 0 1 136 151V174M94 126H102M138 126H146M120 59V78M111 68H129" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M80 196L120 216L160 196" stroke="currentColor" stroke-opacity=".5"/></svg><span>A WORLD THAT REMEMBERS.</span></div></div></div></section>
<section class="unrevealed-life"><div class="container"><div class="unrevealed-world-head"><p class="eyebrow">THE GAME</p><h2>One life ends.<br>Your House continues.</h2><p>An online multiplayer medieval life and dynasty RPG set in a persistent shared world. Shape your character’s life through work, trade, service, crime and faith. Build a family, prepare an heir, and carry your House into the next generation.</p></div><div class="unrevealed-pillars"><div><h3>Make your name</h3><p>Travel between towns, earn your keep, take contracts and build your reputation. Trade at markets, cook and craft, buy a horse, hire protection and camp beyond the town gates. Acquire land, serve a patron, or risk the consequences of life outside the law.</p></div><div><h3>Share the world</h3><p>Meet other players through town, regional and trade chat. Exchange private letters, create or join player-run factions, and buy and sell through market listings. Form marriages between player Houses, or risk asynchronous conflict through caravan interceptions.</p></div><div><h3>Your life is only the beginning</h3><p>Form relationships, marry, have children or adopt an heir. Characters grow older, retire and die. Continue as your successor, inheriting wealth, holdings and consequences from the life that came before.</p></div><div><h3>Leave your mark</h3><p>Record your family’s story in your House Chronicle. Build a legacy across generations in a shared world that continues after your character’s death.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="unrevealed-world" id="world"><div class="container"><div class="unrevealed-world-head"><p class="eyebrow">FIRST LOOK · IN-ENGINE TIMELAPSE</p><h2>One world.<br>Every hour, every season.</h2><p>Dawn mist over the forest. A tide that comes and goes. Storms that roll in over the wheat and clear by sunset. A year that turns from bare branches to snow.</p></div><figure class="unrevealed-film"><video controls playsinline muted preload="none" poster="/media/unrevealed-game/world-timelapse-poster.jpg" width="1920" height="1080" aria-label="Timelapse of the game world through day, night, weather and the seasons"><source src="/media/unrevealed-game/world-timelapse.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video><figcaption>Captured in engine. Work in progress: visuals and details may evolve during development.</figcaption></figure><div class="unrevealed-cycles"><div><h3>Day and night</h3><p>Sunrise to starlight and back, with the moon rising over the sea.</p></div><div><h3>Weather</h3><p>Fair skies, haze, rain and thunder, each changing the light on the land.</p></div><div><h3>Seasons</h3><p>Spring leaf, summer harvest, autumn colour and winter snow.</p></div></div></div></section>
